  m_text: Steal actual treasure from the Gilded Deep. Feather the throttle, use cover
    and avoid horns/crashes. Stop near a treasure and press ACTION to operate the
    physical hoist; ACTION away from treasure releases a carried item. Each rack
    holds three items and 770 LB. Drive the actual loaded truck into reception and
    stop to bank its treasure. Only original objects physically received there score.
    Unbanked cargo earns nothing when the heist closes.
